.	http://purl.oclc.org/NET/cmcs/schema/:hasConfigurations		<rdf:Bag xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" > <rdf:li><rdf:href xlink:href="Parameters/chemsys.mvm" xlink:type="simple"></rdf:href></rdf:li></rdf:Bag>
.	http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/ecce:annotation		Quantum ESPRESSO, PBE-D3(BJ), plane waves (60 Ry), 4x4x5 k-points, atoms relaxed in the fixed cell. This calculation shows a molecular crystal held together by hydrogen bonds from the N-H groups of each urea molecule to the C=O oxygens of its neighbours. Structure: urea (P-421m, neutron diffraction, 12 K), COD 9017318 (Swaminathan and Craven 1984).
.	http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/ecce:application		QuantumESPRESSO
